ses the seek bar's current position or keeps the previous value. When parsing fails, it resets both the text field and seek bar to zero and shows an error. For valid degrees outside the 0-360 range, it applies the same reset behavior.\n\nThe core issue is that keyboard input doesn't update the text field after the seek bar changes. The solution is straightforward: after calling `seekArc.setProgress()`, I should directly update the text field with the parsed degree string to ensure the UI reflects the actual value the user entered.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
